<title>USA: Sun, Kodak work on digital photos.</title>
<headline>Sun, Kodak work on digital photos.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sun Microsystems Inc and Eastman Kodak Co said Wednesday they agreed to work together to develop computer systems that can store photos and digital images on corporate computer networks.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Kodak will provide the image software and Sun will supply the computers and networking technology, the companies said. The products will be aimed at advertising or film companies that need quick access to photos.</p>
</text>
